  "description": "Crunchy, paper thin almond cookies favored with orange.",
  "notes": "Notes: If you have silpat sheets, this is the time to use them. These cookies are incredibly thin and crunchy. It's much easier to peel them off the silicone liners than off greased parchment. Also, don't store these cookies with others as the moisture from the other cookies will cause these to soften.",
